  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for support of the Okra Collaborative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant supports the Okra Collaborative, a transnational network focused on expanding and fortifying Black feminist organizations across the U.S. and the African diaspora. Formed in 2021, Okra was created to increase connectivity, share resources, and exchange ideas across Black feminist movements. Through this grant, Okra will foster Afro/Black feminist leadership, promote interdependence, create convening spaces, and develop collective strategies to address challenges shared by organizations across the diaspora. (Gender Equity and Governance)</narrative>
  </description>
